/d/1zC-NdXNITL101vuiGH2vATsBYGPjAXct/edit?usp=sharing\u0026amp;ouid=114722139359715053228\u0026amp;rtpof=true\u0026amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCellular Energy Review Stations\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"Link\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IECKsV15ktV8xbp38qDCCglGRsP6bRfzTPPXlrPdBH8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCellular Energy Review Stations Student Handout\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"inline_disabled\" title=\"Link\" href=\"https://biomanbio.com/HTML5GamesandLabs/PhotoRespgames/photoresp.html\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBioman Photosynthesis and Cell Respiration Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnzyme review \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dashboard.blooket.com/set/66d859a979d4a50126a320b5\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlooket\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCellular Respiration \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dashboard.blooket.com/set/65a7fc4c3d1b0cb6030b8fef\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblooket\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePhotosynthesis \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dashboard.blooket.com/set/659ee3b474368624735ce47f\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblooket\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnit Success Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBy the end of the unit students will be able to:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003edescribe the function of enzymes as catalysts.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003edescribe what happens to enzymes when exposed to temperatures and pH outside of their normal range.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eanalyze and create models of enzymes and substrates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003edescribe the primary functions of the chloroplast and mitochondria and how they function to maintain homeostasis.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecreate a model that illustrates how the chloroplast and mitochondria function in the flow of energy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecreate a model of the ATP-ADP cycle.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eidentify the inputs, outputs, and functions of photosynthesis.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eidentify the inputs, outputs, and functions of cellular respiration.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003edescribe the steps of photosynthesis and cellular respiration.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003edesign models that demonstrate the cycling of matter and the flow of energy in an organism using cellular respiration and photosynthesis.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003estate the difference between the number of ATP produced from aerobic and anaerobic respiration.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003erelate the difference in the number of ATP produced to oxygen’s role in aerobic respiration.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"}